{"ref":"BDB, סִין²","hw":"סִין²","html":"† II. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">סִין</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.loc.</strong> wilderness between Elim and Sinai, <span dir=\"rtl\">מִדְבַּר־סִין</span>, according to P, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 16:1\" href=\"/Exodus.16.1\">Ex 16:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 17:1\" href=\"/Exodus.17.1\">17:1</a> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 33:11\" href=\"/Numbers.33.11\">Nu 33:11</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 33:12\" href=\"/Numbers.33.12\">12</a>; 𝔊 Σειν, A 𝔊L Σιν; cf. Eb<sup>GS 2. 155 ff.</sup> and especially Di <a data-ref=\"Exodus 16:1\" href=\"/Exodus.16.1\">Ex 16:1</a>.","next":"BDB, סִינַי","prev":"BDB, סִין"}